  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till oberoende media 2013-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to independent media 2013-2015 - amendment April-May 2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Journalism for Rights, Freedom for Journalists- 3&quot; aims at promoting  and applying rights journalism among Turkey&apos;s journalist community as a major instrument in publicizing human rights and democracy, and     continue provide an universally accessible independent channel on the Internet, enhanced with multimedia capacity, for news and information on the principles of rights based reporting.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Journalistik f&#xF6;r r&#xE4;ttigheter, frihet f&#xF6;r journalister-3 syftar till   att fr&#xE4;mja och till&#xE4;mpa r&#xE4;ttighetsbaserad journalistik i TR, som ett  viktigt instrument att belysa m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter och j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet. Insatsen innefattar en webbportal f&#xF6;r publicering av                  r&#xE4;ttighetsbaserad journalistik, sj&#xE4;lva den gr&#xE4;vande journalistiken    samt utbildning f&#xF6;r unga journalister.</narrative>
  </description>
